*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
*%
*% Deli M3100D, монохромное лазерное МФУ (печать/копирование/сканирование).
*% Задание готовит Ghostscript устройством ps2write, его вызывает фильтр
*% deli-rasterize. Файл создан ppd/make-ppds.sh — правьте генератор, не PPD.
*%
*% Ярлыки пунктов оставлены латиницей: CUPS разбирает их как ISOLatin1.
*% Какой из трёх вариантов ваш, показывает поле CMD: в строке Device ID:
*% tools/deli-devid.py. Подробности — docs/02-printing.md.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*Manufacturer: "Deli"
*Product: "(Deli M3100D)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*ModelName: "Deli M3100D"
*ShortNickName: "M3100D PostScript"
*NickName: "Deli M3100D, PostScript (deli-rasterize)"
*PCFileName: "DELI3PS.PPD"
*cupsVersion: 1.4
*cupsModelNumber: 3100
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 deli-rasterize"
*% Устройство Ghostscript, которым фильтр собирает задание.
*DeliGSDevice: "ps2write"
*% Как включать дуплекс: "gs" — параметрами Ghostscript, "pcl5" — командой
*% PCL ESC&l1S, которую Ghostscript для ljet4 не выдаёт.
*DeliDuplexMode: "gs"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Deli;MDL:M3100D;"

*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "31"
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*VariablePaperSize: True
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*Protocols: BCP

*OpenGroup: General/General

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4 210x297mm: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5 148x210mm: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6 105x148mm: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5 JIS 182x257mm: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4 210x297mm: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5 148x210mm: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A6/A6 105x148mm: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5 JIS 182x257mm: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4 210x297mm: "12.00 12.00 583.00 830.00"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "12.00 12.00 600.00 780.00"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "12.00 12.00 600.00 996.00"
*ImageableArea A5/A5 148x210mm: "12.00 12.00 408.00 583.00"
*ImageableArea A6/A6 105x148mm: "12.00 12.00 285.00 408.00"
*ImageableArea B5/B5 JIS 182x257mm: "12.00 12.00 504.00 717.00"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "12.00 12.00 510.00 744.00"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4 210x297mm: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension A5/A5 148x210mm: "420 595"
*PaperDimension A6/A6 105x148mm: "297 420"
*PaperDimension B5/B5 JIS 182x257mm: "516 729"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"

*MaxMediaWidth: "612"
*MaxMediaHeight: "1008"
*HWMargins: 12 12 12 12
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 216 612
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 360 1008
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/1200 dpi: "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long Edge (Standard): "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short Edge (Flip): "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*CloseGroup: General
